    "NTA result statistics for NEET (UG) 2026, published July 2026 (registrations, appearance, qualification, category and score-band data, qualifying percentiles).",
    "NTA press releases on the conduct and cancellation of the 3 May 2026 examination and the 21 June 2026 re-examination.",
    "NMC seat matrix for undergraduate MBBS courses, 2026-27 — nmc.org.in (1,36,939 seats, 823 colleges, 9,911 new seats).",
